      "body": "## Background\n\nUpdate Megatron Bridge's CI runtime to NVIDIA PyTorch 26.09.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Change the default base in `docker/Dockerfile.ci` from `26.08-py3` to `26.09-py3`.\n- Keep dependency pins and build options unchanged.\n\n## Details\n\nThe existing container-build job consumes this Dockerfile default. The separate installation-test workflow remains on 26.06 pending approval to edit workflow files.\n\n## Tested\n\n- Exact-head merge checkout: CI cache-key, Docker dependency-layer, and queue-bypass shell checks passed.\n- CI-pinned pre-commit 3.6.0, all files: passed; Markdown filename hook had no matching files.\n- Clean-tree assertion and `git diff --check`: passed.\n- CPU checks used the published 26.08 CI image; disposable test Git fixtures used unsigned commits, matching CI.\n- Candidate 26.09 image build, imports, unit tests, and functional tests are pending; no runtime compatibility claim yet.",
